WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Set the supports: Position two sturdy books with a 20 cm gap.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Test flat paper: Place one sheet across the gap. Observe its initial shape.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.600
Add small loads: Add coins gently and record the deflection or failure point.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.800
Fold a channel: Fold an identical sheet to form a U-shaped or accordion profile.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.000
Retest: Apply the same loads at the same position and compare.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.200
Compare results: Observe how cross-section changes bending stiffness.

